1
00:00:24,784 --> 00:00:27,264
Hi, Peter. How was your weekend?

2
00:00:27,456 --> 00:00:31,824
It was great! I visited the science museum.

3
00:00:32,304 --> 00:00:34,160
Did you see anything interesting?

4
00:00:34,592 --> 00:00:37,552
Yes, there was a space exhibition.

5
00:00:38,272 --> 00:00:40,080
There were some special rooms,

6
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:43,264
and they looked like parts of a space station.

7
00:00:43,728 --> 00:00:48,688
You could go inside them and see how astronauts live and work!

8
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,960
It was amazing.

9
00:00:51,328 --> 00:00:54,528
Cool! Were there any astronauts there?

10
00:00:54,848 --> 00:00:58,000
Well, no. But there were robots!

11
00:00:58,576 --> 00:01:02,256
I asked one of them questions and it answered me!

12
00:01:02,608 --> 00:01:05,552
Wow! I’d love to go and see them

